= Domestic Extremism

Militias, extremist networks, and violent fringe groups threaten public safety and democratic order across the spectrum.

- @task_force: Create an interagency task force
- @online_extremism: Counter online radicalization
- @prevent_overreach: Safeguard civil liberties
- @easy_discard

@task_force
on-arrival: farright_strength -= 2.5; militia_strength -= 40; farleft_strength -= 0.5; federal_law_loyalty += 0.02; progressive_dissent += 2; month_actions += 1

Federal agencies target violent plots while respecting civil liberties.

@online_extremism
on-arrival: farright_strength -= 1.5; press_freedom -= 1; polarization -= 0.5; progressive_dissent += 2; resources += 0; month_actions += 1

Platforms and prosecutors cooperate, with free-speech critics watching closely.

@prevent_overreach
on-arrival: press_freedom += 1; institutions += 1; progressive_dissent -= 3; farright_strength += 0.5; month_actions += 1

We reaffirm limits on surveillance and protest policing.
